        "tags": [
          "store"
        ],
        "summary": "`GET /jmap/ws` — RFC 8887 JMAP over WebSocket. After the upgrade the\nserver accepts JMAP `Request` frames as text messages and replies with\n`Response` frames; unsolicited `StateChange` pushes are emitted when\nthe changelog advances. Auth is via the `access_token` query param\n(browsers cannot set headers on the upgrade request).",
